    I HAS A D_POW4 ITZ PRODUKT OF PROPELLER_DIAMETER_M AN PRODUKT OF PROPELLER_DIAMETER_M AN PRODUKT OF PROPELLER_DIAMETER_M AN PROPELLER_DIAMETER_M
